# The files that "go generate ./..." writes (12 12.3) are compared byte
# for byte, in the working tree and in the index. "-text" keeps git from
# converting their line endings, so a "text eol=crlf" rule of a user's
# configuration or of a later line cannot make a checkout differ from what
# generate gives. TestGeneratedOutputsAreNotConverted holds this list to
# the outputs of generate.
.github/CODEOWNERS -text
docs/reference/ask-first.md -text
docs/adr/README.md -text
